OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCentral Belt
OL,6,Fand south mainly dry with clear
OL,7,Fperiods. Argyll will be cloudier at
OL,8,Ftimes with showers, occasionally
OL,9,Fheavy. Brisk southwesterly winds along
OL,10,Fthe Argyll coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA mostly dry day with some
OL,13,Fgood spells of sunshine. A few showers
OL,14,Facross Argyll in the morning.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FWindy
OL,17,Fon Tuesday with some patchy rain
OL,18,Flater. Early rain on Wednesday then
OL,19,Fmainly dry and bright. Bright with the
OL,20,Fodd shower on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
